# skill-linter — a real run over four of this marketplace's own plugins.
# Regenerate from this directory: vhs demo.tape   (writes demo.png)
Output "demo.gif"
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1280
Set Height 420
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 15ms
Hide
Type `cd ../../.. && clear`
Enter
Show
Type `python3 plugins/skill-linter/scripts/lint_skills.py plugins/spring-batch plugins/ticket-triage plugins/progress-channel plugins/skill-linter`
Enter
Sleep 3s
Screenshot "demo.png"
Sleep 500ms
